// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3534974664" "Archmage Hellewise"
// ProfessionString :
"P3004023108" "Archmage"
// DescriptionString :
"P906536348" "Archmage Hellewise is a powerful wizard who has studied the thinning veil between First Ward and the pseudo Netherrealm of Night Ward. She believes that travel between the two realms is possible with a simple spell. All she needs is a few volunteers to test it."
// CallTextOverride :
"P274562641" "Sending Spell"
// LocationString :
"P4126942196" "First Ward"
// HelloString :
"P2969003095" "Intriguing, I was just musing over the need for another... Volunteer."
// HelloString :
"P807987816" "It's not how I can help you, but how you can help me."
// HelloString :
"P3270585427" "I'm pleased to see you."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P296928563" "I'm sorry, but my research is very private. I'd prefer to work with someone who I know I can trust."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2886491561" "My research has finally paid off! I've figured out a way to punch through the veil and enter Night Ward. All I need is a brave volunteer to test it. Think about it, you could earn a well earned mention in my notes about how I discovered the means of breaching the barrier between life and death."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3831567551" "You've done everything I need of you. With my research complete and my theories proven I no longer need your assistance. Thank you."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1460842694" "I'm afraid I need someone who can focus on the task at hand. Right now you seem a bit... preoccupied."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P406999949" "I'm afraid the Night Ward is no place for someone of your ability. If you can prove yourself strong enough to handle anything here in First Ward, then I'd feel more comfortable sending you to Night Ward."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P856364347" ""
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
