"P494931281" "Ask about opportunities in Night Ward"
// HelloString :
"P1244249361" "Let's make some wax, {HeroName}."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1319793866" "Pardon me, but I don't believe we've met."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3931876810" "'Allo there, {HeroName}! Name's Atherton Cromwell, Drudge Enforcer. I've heard a bit about you, and I want to propose a little deal.<br><br>You help the Drudges in various tasks around Night Ward, collecting souls, making sure we can collect souls, stopping those who don't want us to collect souls, etc., and we'll see that you're rewarded quite well. Interested?"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3555056283" "You've gotten a bit too powerful to stay underneath the radar, {HeroName}. We'll handle things here."
// PlayerBusyString :
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P4163450894" "Sorry there, {HeroName}, but you're going to have to be more powerful, say around security level 30, if we're going to make money together."
