// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : P_Magician 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : The Magician 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3178469822" "The Magician"
// ProfessionString :
"P1935691705" "Sage of forbidden knowledge"
// DescriptionString :
"P118018040" "The Magician is a mysterious man. Nobody knows how long he has lived, or why he lives in the Netherworld, but what they do know is that he is a keeper of ancient and forbidden knowledge."
// InteractionRequiresText :
// CallTextOverride :
"P423738564" "Seeing stone"
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P1349730516" "Your name is in the thunder."
// HelloString :
"P1077527875" "You return... Good."
// HelloString :
"P2308654684" "The winds told me you were coming."
// HelloString :
"P1608161024" "The stars are watching."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3998895879" "You are not yet known to me, the winds say nothing."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3971235055" "The heavens send lightning to me and it speaks of a great battle to come. {HeroName}, there is great evil beneath the earth and in the sky, are you prepared to face it alone?"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P616527458" "You have pulled order from chaos and righted the wrongs between worlds. While the Night Ward still exists, it is no longer pulling the realms of the living and the dead together. Our work here is done."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P976784933" "You have a storm about you, {HeroName}. Calm the winds, tame the thunder, and soften the rain. Until then, chaos will fill your mind and you will not hear what needs to be heard."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3159483036" "Your power is found lacking... Return to me when your strength is great enough to shake the earth and send daemons fleeing back to hell."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3781260321" "The daemons fear you, {HeroName}. You have impressed both them and me with your power. If you should ever need to contact me, just look into this seeing stone and you will find me looking back."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2456643543" "Lightning and thunder speak your name and carry your legend across the heavens. Even the stars watch you now, eager to see how your story unfolds... and mine."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P791713343" "Daemons have allowed you to read this line, this should not be possible."
// IntroString :
"P1154541350" "There is no doubt to me that he is a powerful sorcerer, but I sensed in him a keen awareness of the calamity befalling the Night Ward and the realms of the living and the dead. He says he is waiting for someone, but did not say who. I believe it is you he waits for. If so, I can only hope it is so he can provide you with answers on how to stop the Black Queen and the Talons of Vengeance."
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3627234306" "The Magician is a powerful entity. Some say he is a man, but any who have met him know otherwise. He knows things that cannot and should not be known. To deal with him is to walk the knife's edge. There will always be a price in blood, but unless one treads carefully, they will surely fall."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


