// ProfessionString :
"P3564914776" "Carnival of Light Mistress"
// DescriptionString :
"P2667060163" "Mistress Maria is one of the powerful sorceresses in the Carnival of Light. She was one of the first to join the Carnival of Light, back when she was a simple mystic. Now, she has earned her place within the core of the group and intends to do whatever she can to help First ward."
// InteractionRequiresText :
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P3851685011" "Let us get to the task."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P423827887" "I must focus, {HeroName}, please come back later."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3555790621" "{HeroName}, you have arrived. I have been tasked with resolving the issue of the woman known as Katie Douglas. We will make sure that she is not lost to the world like so many others were."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P724598922" "We are done, {HeroName}. I wish you luck in your future works."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3413302836" "You have too many threads relying on you right now, {HeroName}. Come back when you've freed yourself."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2105229146" "I'm afraid that you must grow in power before we can continue our good works together."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1934417886" "How are you reading this? You should not see this."
