// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : P_Montague_Castanella 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Montague Castanella 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1415935792" "Montague Castanella"
// ProfessionString :
"P516198588" "Leader of the Midnight Squad"
// DescriptionString :
"P1529559199" "When he was alive, Montague Castanella had inherited the role of the leader of the Midnight Squad, a role that he accepted grudgingly if only because circumstances forced him into it. Under his leadership the Midnighters survived Cole's witch hunts and stole themselves away into the shadowy psuedo-dimension between the worlds of the living and the dead. Here they had taken the Midnight Mansion, an arcane fortress that was beyond the reach of Emperor Cole. But it was from within their own ranks that the Midnighters would ultimately fall. Killed by their former friend and ally, Percy Winkley, the Midnighters became, for a time, the Midnight Masters, undead servants of Percy Winkley as he adopted the new monicker, Master Midnight. But with Percy's demise his spell over the Midnighters has faded and their will is once more their own. Now these poor souls are trapped between worlds and linger between life and death, unable to find true peace. Luckily, for a wizard, an eternity spent in study is not a punishment, and Montague Castanella is looking forward to delving ever deeper into the realm of the arcane."
// InteractionRequiresText :
// CallTextOverride :
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P1157141075" "There's no teacher like experience."
// HelloString :
"P457780715" "Splendid as always."
// HelloString :
"P1847488737" "You've returned. It is good to see you."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3110198518" "The Midnight Mansion's doors are open to any who need protection. Now tell me, who are you again?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P3755404432" "{HeroName}, I'm looking forward to working together."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2918198375" "My efforts are now focused on keeping the Midnight Mansion secure against the forces arrayed against us. I am certain there are others in Night Ward that need your talents."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1119230811" "You seem to have your hands in all the pies, {HeroName}. Come back once you are ready to focus on the task at hand."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1899391687" "The Night Ward is a dangerous place, but I can tell you have great potential. Come back once you are cleared for, say, Level 30 security clearance."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1033720508" "We're making great progress, but we cannot let up now. I knew this would be a wildly successful venture together, and I am grateful to be a part of it."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1190241334" "If ever you are in need, I will be there, {HeroName}."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3543230041" "You shouldn't see this."
// IntroString :
"P2583526916" "Montague was once the leader of the Midnighters. If Percy Winkley's mastery over his mind, and the minds of the other Midnighters has been broken, then he may well prove a powerful ally in the bizarre realm of Night Ward."
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
"P424920169" "Montague Castanella and the remnants of the Midnighters need your help."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1580037036" "Ward is the Overspell of the Midnight Mansion. Percy Winkley had added a semblance of sentience to its magic in an effort to stop Cerulean, but now, it seems, that along with all of the other spells in Night Ward, Ward has gained even greater intelligence and is asking about where its children have gone."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


