// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : P_Sir_Bedwyr 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Sir Bedwyr 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3606008519" "Sir Bedwyr"
// ProfessionString :
"P4085499187" "Questing Knight"
// DescriptionString :
"P2705581074" "Sir Bedwyr is a Black Knight, sworn to defend the Eternal Prison and contain the evil that lies within. He believes that a great evil threatens the Netherworld and seeks to breach the Eternal Prison, and his quest and vow to his brotherhood, will see this evil vanquished."
// InteractionRequiresText :
// CallTextOverride :
"P1158693160" "Send a Hellraven"
// AskAboutTextOverride :
"P4143092579" "On with the quest"
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P1536418610" "Hail."
// HelloString :
"P3564139770" "Well met."
// HelloString :
"P2999602992" "What word do you bring?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P102200645" "Pardon my reservation, but I do not deal with those who I do not know."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1097411646" "I know you... Clarity told me about you, {HeroName}. I hear you are no friend of the Talons of Vengeance. That is good, we share a common foe."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1652764512" "The Knights Penitent are my charge now, {HeroName}. I can ask nothing more of you."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2238512243" "You try to accomplish too much, too quickly. Focus your efforts and you will not be overwhelmed. Speak to me when you are focused."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1585856118" "The Night Ward is no place for one as skilled as you are. Come back when you have increased your skill and strength, and then together we will stand against the Talons of Vengeance."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P942353834" "Like Clarity, I am honored to know you, {HeroName}. From this moment forth, you are my {hero.gender=male Sword Brother|Sword Sister}. If ever you need to send word to me, you can send a message by hellraven, they'll know how to find me."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3075422964" "I would be honored if you were to accept the honorary title of Knight Penitent. I could not have done any of this without you, {HeroName}. You have my eternal gratitude."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2981502509" "Thou should not be seeing this."
// IntroString :
"P3739726688" "Sir Bedwyr is a creature of honor. Clarity's memories show that he helped defend her and my other children from the Talons of Vengeance. Together they learned of the Talon attack on the Midnight Mansion and she abandoned his protection to come to my own. Let Bedwyr know that Clarity's sacrifice saved us all and that she died with honor, he will appreciate that."
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1024358185" "A Black Knight sworn to protect the Eternal Prison, Sir Bedwyr is on a quest to uncover a great evil that threatens not only the Netherworld but the Black Knights themselves."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P82850868" "There is one who may be able to help us, but he is strange and powerful. A magician who can read lightning and speak to demons. If any know a way to stop The Black Queen and the Talons of Vengeance, it will be him. Whether he will help you, however, I cannot say."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


