// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P4053508470" "Sir Lionel"
// ProfessionString :
"P221202665" "Black Knight Armiger"
// DescriptionString :
"P2480704140" "Sir Lionel is one of the noblest of the Black Knights. He has been requested to work with outsiders in order to ensure the peace and safety of Night Ward."
// LocationString :
// CallTextOverride :
// AskAboutTextOverride :
"P3990319760" "Offer to help defend Night Ward"
// HelloString :
"P1935315501" "Let us restore order to Night Ward."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3328246328" "Pardon me, but I don’t have time to talk at the moment."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3220332773" "{HeroName}. I am Sir Lionel of the Black Knights. I will spare the formalities. Night Ward is in danger, as you can tell. The forces of chaos threaten to destroy this place from within.<Br><br>I have been tasked with fending off this chaos, but I cannot do it without the help of outsiders such as yourself. Will you lend your aid in fending off the anarchy that lurks in the hearts of those within this cursed place?"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P252614321" "You have done everything you can, {HeroName}, and I thank you for your assistance. Your powerful talents can be used elsewhere, I'm sure of it."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2187646152" "You must finish what you've been tasked with, {HeroName}."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3158580449" "You are not powerful enough to fight back the chaos of this place, {HeroName}. Return when you are at least Security Level 30."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
