"P855507779" "Three books titled Book the First, the Second Book, and the Final Book tell the coming of age story of a young hero being mentored by Epoch, a wise old man who holds a secret. The books seem to refuse to tell you the story in the proper order, but seem to randomly offer up chapters out of order."
// LocationString :
