"P1115823635" "The pages of the story open, anxious to show themselves to you."
// IDontKnowYouString :
// FirstVisitString :
"P698691965" "A trilogy of books stands before you. They tell a classic coming of age tale of good overcoming evil. A glance at the books shows that the main character is based on you, and even has your name!"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3209106501" "And they lived happily ever after."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2293359222" "The books stay shut. (You have too many active missions)."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P299867733" "These books need a protagonist of a higher level."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1624727929" "The books greet you warmly."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P86306964" "The books are anxious to finish the story."
