// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : P_Ward 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Ward 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1767765797" "Ward"
// ProfessionString :
"P2951617646" "Overspell of the Midnight Mansion"
// DescriptionString :
"P4279588181" "Ward is the sentient Overspell that is in charge of managing all of the magical defenses of the Midnight Mansion in Night Ward. However, now the Animus Arcana, Ward's 'spell children', have abandoned both the Spellfather and their posts. Ward adheres to his loyalty to the Midnighters and the defense of the Mansion, but without the Animus Arcana how effective will he be in this endeavor?"
// InteractionRequiresText :
// CallTextOverride :
"P3897321123" "Arcane Message"
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P713006908" "Conflaguration spell sequence halted, hello {HeroName}."
// HelloString :
"P2788814047" "Welcome."
// HelloString :
"P2241816399" "Hello, friend."
// HelloString :
"P3873676348" "Welcome to my home."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1144401951" "Augury suggests that there are no fate threads currently linking us. Good bye."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3439522034" "I am called Ward. I am the Overspell of the Midnight Mansion. I am the Spellfather of the spell children known as the Animus Arcana. Your presence is greatly appreciated, {HeroName}."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3028103417" "The Mansion is secure, but I will not rest until the Talons of Vengeance are stopped."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1769049577" "Your threads of fate intersect with many others.  Weave your fate into a single string and the fates will guide you back to me."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1539612391" "You require more experience and knowledge before you can aid in the Midnight Mansion's defenses."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P687802025" "You are powerful and courageous. I consider you a potent ally and friend. If you ever need to speak with me just say my name and an Arcane Message will be sent. Just try to keep it under twenty-five words."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P4110482515" "Many nights from now, when the last of my spell energy has been expended, and the life gifted to me has returned to the cycle of all things, my spell children will continue to weave the tale of our creation, our fight for our right to live, and how Ward Spellfather and {HeroName} won that fight."
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
"P1900473985" "<img align=left src=Night_Ward_Contact_Ward width=96 height=96>Ward is the Overspell of binding that once unified all of the Midnight Mansion's glyphs, wards, and defensive magics. But now that it and the other spells have become Animus Arcana, Ward is having difficulty adequately defending the mansion. It would be most helpful to consult with Ward and discover what can be done to shore up the Midnight Mansion's defenses."
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
"P223363224" "Ward has asked for help in locating its children, the Animus Arcana. Ward has asked for you specifically."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3112788930" "Sir Bedwyr shares a loathing of the Talons of Vengeance and will make a powerful ally against them."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


