// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Whispering Coyote 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P4201127113" "Whispering Coyote"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P634757418" "Whispering Coyote is a spirit animal and one of many forms belonging to a trickster deity common to many world mythologies. He appeared to Blind Makwa in a waking dream after his spirit sight was restored and has promised answers to the enigma surrounding a place called the Night Ward."
// InteractionRequiresText :
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P638210228" "Ki-yi-yi!"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1950139751" "Ki-yi-yi-yi?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P64547607" "Ki-yi!<br><br>The Night Ward is a dangerous and sullen place. You would do well to find a spirit companion to help guide you.<br><br>Ki-yi-yi!"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P102249052" "Ki-yi-ki-yi!<br><br>Sorry, but I think there are others who need your help. Me, I'm fine right here.<br><br>Ki-yi!"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3484016021" "Ki-ki-yi!<br><br>I've heard about you from the wind and other spirits. You are doing quite a lot. Make sure not to bite off more than you can swallow, or you might find yourself standing in line with the Drudges.<br><br>Yi-yi!"
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2081028684" "Ki-ki!"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2610004391" "Ki-ki-ki!<br><br>It takes a lot to befriend a coyote, {HeroName}. I'm not saying that you have, but you're moving in the right direction.<br><br>Yi-yi-ki!"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P162379302" "Ki-ki-ki-yi!<br><br>I am as loyal to you as you have proven to be to me. If you ever need anything, call my name into the wind and I'll be there.<br><br>Ki-yi-ki!"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3125861744" "Ki-yi! You shouldn't be seeing this."
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

